1
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:07,157
[part2有个主持人] First of all, let me thank you all for coming to this public meeting, to discuss the future of our town.

2
00:00:07,157 --> 00:00:12,797
Our first speaker is Shona Ferguson, from Barford town council. Shona.

3
00:00:12,797 --> 00:00:21,297
(Q11（单选）) Thank you. First I'll briefly give you some background information, then I'll be asking you for your comments on developments in the town.

4
00:00:21,297 --> 00:00:30,245
Well, as you don't need me to tell you, Barford has changed a great deal in the last 50 years. These are some of the main changes.

5
00:00:30,245 --> 00:00:37,081
[🟢◾️题干定位词 buses出现，] Fifty years ago, buses linked virtually every part of the town and the neighbouring towns and villages.&nbsp;

6
00:00:37,081 --> 00:00:45,719
[Q11答案句 ✅C 只在乘客多的线路安排bus= 没有那么多线路了 ， 以及， 判断出题目有fewer，【程度】考点，又听到程度词most 就必须关注] Most people used them frequently, but not now, because the bus companies concentrate on just the routes that attract most passengers.

7
00:00:45,719 --> 00:00:49,868
So parts of the town are no longer served by buses.

8
00:00:49,868 --> 00:00:57,209
[❌A 断章取义： 原文说 就算把old&uncomfortable换了， 也没用（have little impact）] Even replacing old uncomfortable buses with smart new ones has had little impact on passenger numbers.

9
00:00:57,209 --> 00:01:06,787
[❌B 否定原文： 明确否定票价涨幅过大] It's sometimes said that bus fares are too high, but in relation to average incomes, fares are not much higher than they were 50 years ago.

10
00:01:06,787 --> 00:01:11,019
(Q12) [🟢◾️Q12 定位词 road network出现 （名词），🟠考点词： benefit+ most 程度+态度] Changes in the road network are affecting the town.

11
00:01:11,019 --> 00:01:17,653
[❌C：偷换概念 且程度不一，center was closed to traffic 虽然是banning of cars， 但效果还在评估， 断章取义] The centre was recently closed to traffic on a trial basis, making it much safer for pedestrians.

12
00:01:17,653 --> 00:01:20,855
[但效果还在评估 —— 断章取义 ❌C] The impact of this is being measured.

13
00:01:20,855 --> 00:01:31,819
[Q12答案句 ✅选项B cycle path原词， be used far more than = 在选项发展； reducing+improving 都表示题干的benefit] The new cycle paths, separating bikes from cars in most main roads, are being used far more than was expected, reducing traffic and improving air quality.

14
00:01:31,819 --> 00:01:41,581
[❌A否定原文， bypass这个想法 have failed] And although the council's attempts to have a bypass constructed have failed, we haven't given up hope of persuading the government to change its mind.

15
00:01:41,581 --> 00:01:45,242
(Q13) [🟢◾️定位词shopping （名词），🟠考点词 判断为 problem（态度）] Shopping in the town centre has changed over the years.

16
00:01:45,242 --> 00:01:49,700
Many of us can remember when the town was crowded with people going shopping.

17
00:01:49,700 --> 00:01:57,930
[❌A 否定原文， despite提供停车场，数字还是falling] Numbers have been falling for several years, despite efforts to attract shoppers, for instance by opening new car parks.

18
00:01:57,930 --> 00:02:03,129
[❌C 断章取义， 说的只是有些人会把两件事（restaurant&cafe）合在一起干。] Some people combine shopping with visits to the town's restaurants and cafes.

19
00:02:03,129 --> 00:02:16,092
[Q13答案句 ✅B， 说大家更愿意去的是 📚well known chain store = major retailer 【同义替换】] Most shops are small independent stores, which is good, but many people prefer to use supermarkets and department stores in nearby large towns, as there are so few well-known chain stores here.

20
00:02:16,092 --> 00:02:28,204
(Q14) [无考点词，有🟢◾️定位词medical facilities ❌B 虽然提到了medical practices， 但 plan相关的事未提及，无中生有。] Turning now to medical facilities, the town is served by family doctors in several medical practices - fewer than 50 years ago, but each catering for far more patients.

21
00:02:28,204 --> 00:02:34,639
[Q14答案句 ✅A， 15年前close了，那就是现在no hospital] Our hospital closed 15 years ago, which means journeys to other towns are unavoidable.

22
00:02:34,639 --> 00:02:38,973
[❌C 否定原文，  选项too low，原文more detists than used to be，] On the other hand, there are more dentists than there used to be.

23
00:02:38,973 --> 00:02:43,330
(Q15) [🟢◾️定位词顺延寻找：已画出employ——题干be  employed in📚同义替换定位（换词性）。 🟠考点词：程度 largest] Employment patterns have changed, along with almost everything else.

24
00:02:43,330 --> 00:02:48,383
[Q15答案句 ✅C， main sector = 题干largest number of people， 📚 schools and colleges 🟰 education] The number of schools and colleges has increased, making that the main employment sector.

25
00:02:48,383 --> 00:02:53,635
[❌A，变得重要 也不等于 最多人从事， 偷换概念] Services, such as website design and accountancy, have grown in importance,

26
00:02:53,635 --> 00:03:03,360
[❌B 未见衰退 不等于largest number of people， 偷换概念/断章取义] and surprisingly, perhaps, manufacturing hasn't seen the decline that has affected it in other parts of the country.

27
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:05,860
(Q16（配对）) Now I'll very quickly outline current plans for some of the town's facilities, before asking for your comments.

